  "mp4": "https://www.sandbase.ai/lab/media/x/gemini-4-neon/2123220446074253768/video.mp4",
  "promptShared": true,
  "promptText": "Gemini 4 Neon by @GoogleDeepMind is now available on DesignArena!\n\nGemini 4 Neon is Google DeepMind’s fast new model for coding and science, priced at $3 per million input tokens, $15 per million output tokens, and $0.15 per million cached input tokens.\n\nAt launch, Google DeepMind showed Gemini 4 Neon building a Mont Blanc ski simulator. We gave Gemini 4 Neon and Gemini 4 Argon a similar setting, asking both to generate a detailed one-shot scene set in the Alps: a wooden hut on a snowy ridge at sunset, with glowing windows, chimney smoke, and skis leaning by the door. A lift climbs up to the hut, a few pine trees stand in the snow below, and jagged mountains rise in the background.\n\nGemini 4 Neon’s pine trees look more realistic, while Gemini 4 Argon’s snow sits in layers that fit perfectly around its trees. In the background, Gemini 4 Neon’s mountains are sharp and conical, while Gemini 4 Argon’s have more texture. Gemini 4 Neon also adds light snowfall unprompted.\n\nCongrats to the @GoogleDeepMind team on the launch!",
  "featured": null,
